[TITLE]
FILE-03: two rules on tank T1, one tests FILLTIME and one tests DRAINTIME

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   700   150

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   800

[TANKS]
;ID  Elev  InitLevel  MinLevel  MaxLevel  Diameter  MinVol
 T1  850   120        100       150       50.5      0

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P2  J1  T1  1000    12    100    0      Open

[RULES]
RULE R1
IF TANK T1 FILLTIME BELOW 1.5      ; hours
THEN PIPE P2 STATUS IS CLOSED

RULE R2
IF TANK T1 DRAINTIME > 2.25        ; hours
THEN PIPE P2 STATUS IS OPEN

[TIMES]
 Duration  24:00

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
